WEBVTT

00:10:29.516 --> 00:10:30.516
(Chuckles)

00:10:30.556 --> 00:10:31.996
try and ask her,

00:10:32.036 --> 00:10:34.956
"How do you think we should solve
the climate crisis?"

00:10:34.996 --> 00:10:37.436
Chances are, she will say,

00:10:37.476 --> 00:10:41.436
"The answer, my friend,
is literally blowing in the wind."

00:10:41.476 --> 00:10:42.636
(Laughter)

00:10:42.636 --> 00:10:43.796
Thank you.

00:10:43.836 --> 00:10:45.396
(Applause)

00:10:45.436 --> 00:10:48.796
[Take action on climate change
at countdown.ted.com]